+-- Did a mod (or an NX derived save) replace this asset?  The question callers
+-- actually mean when they gate on "did the vanilla art change" (the battle
+-- anim/pic-mismatch guards).  Comparing Assets.resolve(path) ~= path used to
+-- answer it, but that breaks on 3DS: consoleTexture swaps EVERY shipped .png
+-- for its .t3x sibling, so vanilla art reads as replaced and the guard dies.
+--
+-- Measured against the same console swap rather than against `path`, so the
+-- build-format rewrite cancels out and only a real override remains.  Goes
+-- through resolve() instead of re-implementing the override lookup, so the
+-- two can never disagree and anything that wraps resolve is still honoured.
+function Assets.isOverridden(path)
+  if type(path) ~= "string" then return false end
+  local base = Console.is3DS() and consoleTexture(path) or path
+  return Assets.resolve(path) ~= base
+end
